1
00:00:00,399 --> 00:00:02,560
Imagine waking up to find a strange image

2
00:00:02,560 --> 00:00:04,260
on a random Internet forum.

3
00:00:04,880 --> 00:00:06,720
It is just a black background with white

4
00:00:06,720 --> 00:00:09,059
text saying they are looking for highly intelligent

5
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:09,700
individuals.

6
00:00:10,719 --> 00:00:14,675
This was the start of cicada 03/2011.

7
00:00:14,675 --> 00:00:16,455
It was not a prank or a game.

8
00:00:16,835 --> 00:00:19,154
It was a global digital scavenger hunt that

9
00:00:19,154 --> 00:00:20,615
spanned the entire world.

10
00:00:21,235 --> 00:00:24,375
People had to decipher complex codes using cryptography,

11
00:00:24,595 --> 00:00:25,095
steganography,

12
00:00:25,715 --> 00:00:28,110
and even physical clues hidden in different

13
00:00:28,990 --> 00:00:31,070
cities. Thousands tried to solve it, but only

14
00:00:31,070 --> 00:00:33,090
a handful ever reached the end.

15
00:00:33,630 --> 00:00:35,950
And here is the kicker. To this day,

16
00:00:35,950 --> 00:00:38,510
nobody knows who created it or what happens

17
00:00:38,510 --> 00:00:39,810
when you actually win.

18
00:00:40,395 --> 00:00:42,395
Was it a recruitment drive for a secret

19
00:00:42,395 --> 00:00:42,895
society,

20
00:00:43,275 --> 00:00:44,655
or something much darker?

21
00:00:45,195 --> 00:00:47,755
The trail went cold years ago, leaving us

22
00:00:47,755 --> 00:00:49,055
with nothing but questions.

23
00:00:49,835 --> 00:00:51,835
Some say the answers are still out there

24
00:00:51,835 --> 00:00:54,255
waiting for the right mind to decode them.

25
00:00:54,715 --> 00:00:56,327
Are you brave enough to look for them?
